WEBVTT

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:17.600
<i>Misumi-san?</i>

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:21.870
<i>She took the long way around to her seat
by going through the back of the classroom.</i>

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:22.920
<i>But why?</i>

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:27.380
Self-control

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:34.340
Can you keep it a secret?

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:39.850
Will you keep it a secret if I tell you the reason?

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:41.350
Self-control

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:43.380
Yeah.

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:31.290
Hey, Darts'un!

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:32.990
Earth to Darts'un!

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:36.420
Over here!

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:40.300
What's up?

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.300
Can I borrow your English textbook?

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:45.060
I can't find Haruru, so yours'll have to do.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:48.300
Mine'll "have to do," huh?
So I'm second fiddle to Niimi-san?

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:52.150
Well, Haruru keeps neat and
easy-to-understand notes in her textbook.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.760
Oh, I'll be down in a bit. You guys go on ahead.

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:55.750
All right.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:03:00.110
Your textbook's pretty great, though.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:03.200
It's just like a new copy since you don't take notes at all!

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.920
So lemme borrow yours!

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:06.920
What'll I do with you?

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:09.300
Go grab it yourself. It's in my locker.

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:11.740
Thanks! I owe you one!

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:16.460
I know Darts'un's locker only too well.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.600
Whoa, look at all these textbooks! Way to go, Darts'un!

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:21.460
You'll never take any of them home with you.

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:23.980
Stop talking so much and
just take what you need.

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:26.240
Yeah, I know!

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:33.600
Wh-Wh-Whoa!

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:37.000
S-Sorry! You okay?

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:40.020
Of course I'm not!

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:40.860
That was dangerous.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:43.000
What kind of stunt were you trying to pull?

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:46.600
I wasn't trying to do anything. It was just an accident.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:48.660
That "accident" is the problem.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.660
The same thing happened before.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:52.710
Which year and class are you in?

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:55.000
I'm Maeda Kazuya of class 2-B.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.400
Maeda-kun, huh?

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.300
I'm—

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.420
Muroto-san, the Student Council President, right?

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:01.300
Yes, that's right.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:03.550
That simplifies things if you know who I am.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:06.700
If you had followed the school rules and kept to your right,

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:08.800
you wouldn't be running into people.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.960
Huh? We have a school rule like that?

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:14.940
You didn't know? Unbelievable.

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:18.820
Student Info One, Article Five under "Life in School."

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:22.070
"No running in the corridors or on the stairs. Always keep to your right."

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:28.220
"Head to your next class ahead of time. When the bell rings, be seated and wait for class to start."

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:30.540
Got that? Make sure you read the Student Handbook.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:32.540
I got it.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.460
I got it, but uh...

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:38.040
Do you really know <i>all</i> the school rules by heart, Senpai?

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:40.180
Of course I do.

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:42.300
Any student council president would.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:43.860
I see.

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:48.120
Now that you know, make sure you keep to your right when moving around. Got it?

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.460
Got it.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:50.560
All right. Bye.

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:57.060
She's pretty strict.

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.450
Oh, Niimi-san.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.240
Need a hand?

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.820
Oh, Maeda-kun.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.330
Nah, I'll be fine.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.920
I can carry this myself.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:13.960
Softball, huh?

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:16.040
Yes. Are the boys outside for today, too?

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:18.170
Yeah, we have soccer.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.050
Your stomach...

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.420
O-Oh, I'm fine.

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:28.840
<i>Crap, I didn't have breakfast.</i>

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:32.100
So, Maeda-kun, you joined the Photography Club?

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:34.260
Kano-chan told me.

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:35.540
I see.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:38.140
Isn't this the first time you've joined a club?

00:05:38.140 --> 00:05:42.520
You didn't join any in elementary school or middle school.

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:47.110
The club president was really
aggressive about it, so I couldn't refuse.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.040
I see.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.740
So what kind of club activities
does the Photography Club do?

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.500
Let's see...

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:02.800
The president said something about
preserving the youth of the students.

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:06.340
Preserving our youth, huh?

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:07.340
That's wonderful.

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:09.360
I-I guess.

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:13.100
If you're all right with Tennis Club, feel free to come and take photos.

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:16.230
You need to preserve our youth too!

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.270
Something wrong?

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.070
Nah, I'm fine.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.900
It's kinda bright around here.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:30.360
<i>Damn it, Maeda! Get out of our way!</i>

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:33.660
<i>Couldn't he move to the side a little?</i>

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.740
<i>Don't these guys have class?</i>

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:39.910
Well then, I'd better get going. Everyone's waiting.

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:41.290
O-Okay.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.420
Actually, wait!

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:45.800
I think I'll help after all!

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:49.800
<i>The Photography Club, huh?</i>

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.680
<i>I don't know if it's as simple as them being true to their desires.</i>

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.810
<i>They're a lot sketchier than I had thought.</i>

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.480
Maeda-kun! Maeda-kun!

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:00.810
Those are indoor shoes!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.230
Oh no!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.760
Go back and change them.

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:07.740
I'll be fine from here.

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:11.530
Okay, see you later.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.360
Yeah, see you!

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:16.240
Thanks, Maeda-kun!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:24.380
Maeda!

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:25.960
Got it!

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:31.640
Maeda, we're heading up first.

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:33.300
O-Okay.

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.140
I'm starving.

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:37.970
Will I make it to lunchtime?

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:43.680
I know you're there, Kanon.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:44.700
Huh?!

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.110
How'd you know?

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:47.820
The sound of your bell.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:50.150
The one strapped to your phone.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:51.990
Oh.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.120
I'm starving, by the way.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.700
Got anything on you?

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:58.940
Wow, your tummy's really grumbling.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.620
I had no idea it could grumble that loudly.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.120
Yeah.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.340
Guess there's no helping it!

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:06.880
I'll give you something nice.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:10.300
Tada!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.550
Whoa, thanks!

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:18.760
I bought it to drink after morning
practice, but luckily for you I didn't!

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.810
Well? Does it taste good?

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:24.810
Yeah, but it's kinda warm.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.060
Sorry!

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:29.820
It was in my skirt the whole time.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:35.570
You've got guts to be snacking during break, Maeda-kun.

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:37.000
M-Muroto?!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.830
You okay, Niiyan?

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.380
Wrong pipe...

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:45.880
Student Info, Article Twelve under "Life in School."

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:49.550
"All eating and drinking outside of lunchtime must be done at the canteen."

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:53.550
"This does not apply if you have permission
from your teacher or during club activities."

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:56.180
Oh, I didn't know about that rule.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:59.850
Both of you should read every last line of the Student Handbook.

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:00.850
Right.

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:01.780
Okay.

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:04.960
Drink the rest of that at the canteen. Got it?

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.310
Got it.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:11.560
Muroto-senpai's really strict about enforcing the school rules, huh?

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:12.860
Too strict.

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:15.860
She's so amazing and pretty, though.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:19.870
By the way, I'm surprised you
still carry that bell with you.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:22.870
But of course!

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:27.880
You gave it to me when we were really young. It's precious to me.

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:30.380
I keep it with me everywhere I go!

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:46.100
<i>After school ended, I encountered a problem with being a Photography Club member.</i>

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:04.450
Senpai? L-Let's talk outside!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:06.460
What? Really?

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:07.560
Yes.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:12.960
Members of the Photography Club are banned from entering the gym during rhythmic gymnastics practice.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.050
How come?

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:16.590
Well, you see...

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:21.100
They kept taking photos of us
from really embarrassing angles.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:23.350
Must be Nakagawa and Azuma.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:25.180
Seriously, those guys...

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.860
You didn't know?

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:27.850
Of course not!

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.480
That's good.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:34.050
I was really surprised when Kano-chan
told me you joined the Photography Club.

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:37.460
I knew you would <i>never</i> take pictures like that!

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:38.900
Of course I wouldn't.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.580
This isn't good.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:44.840
I just started to get into photography,
and I'm already running into all these limits.

00:10:45.730 --> 00:10:51.880
I'll talk to the club president and ask her
to give you special permission to come in.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:54.380
Really? Would you?

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:55.860
Definitely!

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:56.880
I'll go ask her right now!

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:00.380
Good job, man.

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:03.850
N-Nakagawa?!

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:04.760
How long have you been there?

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:08.770
MaiKano are by far the most popular freshman girls.

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:13.770
Kudos for getting a special exception on the ban!

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:15.400
The problem was getting
banned in the first place.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:18.480
And who are MaiKano?

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:21.700
Mai would be Mai-chan, so who's Kano?

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.910
Maeda Kanon, of course!

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.640
That's gross!

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:29.410
Was it that much of a shock to you?

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:31.670
Listen, and listen well, Nakagawa.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:32.420
Huh?

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.670
Kanon's my younger sister!

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:36.420
Younger sister?!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.210
<i>Your</i> younger sister?!

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:42.430
Y-You serious?

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.680
Totally serious.

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:46.100
Oh wait.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:51.770
Wouldn't that mean I'll have to call you "Onii-sama"?

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.560
Stop! That's gross as hell!

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:56.940
Don't be so mean, <i>Onii-sama</i>!

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:59.990
Onii-sama!

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:00.440
Stop, you're giving me goosebumps!

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:03.450
I said that's enough!

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:04.530
I'll make her happy!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:04.620
No freaking way!

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.780
She'll never be happy with you! No way!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:11.210
<i>A lot has happened since I started photography.</i>

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:14.460
<i>It wasn't because of the camera,</i>

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:13.710
FIRE ALARM

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:20.220
<i>but rather because of how I've become more proactive in approaching people to take their picture.</i>

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:23.940
<i>It's like a completely different world.</i>

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:36.150
Taking pictures of the shoe lockers?

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.960
Well, something like that.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:42.480
Oh, I haven't told you my name yet.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:43.440
I'm—

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:44.200
I know.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.820
Katsumi-san told me about you.

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.480
I-I see.

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:49.540
So uh, Sanehara-san...

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.380
Just Sanehara's fine.

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:52.580
Right, Sanehara.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:53.830
Can I ask you something?

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:55.220
What?

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:58.420
The photo you just took... That's backlighting, right?

00:12:58.420 --> 00:12:59.840
Yes, that's right.

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:04.280
When I try backlighting, I can't get a good picture because everything's really dark.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:06.260
Is there a trick to it?

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.480
Nothing wrong with everything being dark.

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:10.970
As long as it has atmosphere.

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:15.230
Well, I guess so.

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:19.400
Uh, you could use exposure compensation.

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:20.900
Exposure compensation?

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:24.240
I see. Exposure compensation, huh?

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.900
I see now.

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:29.840
Oh, excuse me.

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:31.160
And thanks!

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:36.800
Tomorrow after school, all members are to assemble in the clubroom!

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:38.900
We are holding an emergency meeting!

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:43.300
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:49.640
I was so worried that I couldn't sleep last night.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.720
What'll they say to me after school?

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:55.270
Oh, Maeda-kun!

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:57.340
Niimi-san?

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:00.400
You haven't changed yet?

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.780
Y-Yeah.

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:05.250
I forgot to take my scrunchie with me, so I came back for it.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.720
I see.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:07.740
Well, see you around.

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:09.620
Um, wait!

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:10.780
Huh?

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:14.460
Um... I-I can model for you.

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:16.460
What'd you say?

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:20.050
I said I can model for you.

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:21.750
In your swimsuit?

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:23.280
Y-Yes.

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:26.060
Gravure idols usually wear swimsuits, right?

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:28.580
I guess so, but...

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:32.100
It's embarrassing, but I'll do my best.

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:34.690
I want to help you.

00:14:34.690 --> 00:14:35.890
Niimi-san...

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.980
Why would you go so far for me?

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:43.060
Because I want to be with you more, like how we used to be.

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:43.960
I can't?

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:45.900
No, I don't mind...

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:46.900
Then do it!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.400
Take photos of me.

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:53.530
If you're fine with it, I'd like you to take photos of me.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:55.040
I want you to look at me!

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.060
Niimi-san...

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:08.050
<i>And that's how our secret photo shoot took place.</i>

00:15:09.730 --> 00:15:11.240
L-Like this?

00:15:19.990 --> 00:15:20.940
Nice.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.400
Very nice.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.280
This is embarrassing.

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:51.840
Okay, let's head back.

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:54.260
You won't show these to anyone, right?

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:55.350
Of course I won't.

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:59.020
I'm doing this only for you, Maeda-kun.

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:01.730
S-See you!

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:11.530
Leisurely I face my inkstone all day long,

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:18.830
and without any particular object jot down
the odds and ends that pass through my mind,

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:20.950
with a curious feeling that I am not sane.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.720
<i>Can you keep it a secret?</i>

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.630
<i>Can you keep it a secret?</i>

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.940
Well! Being born into this world...

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:36.600
Will you keep it a secret if I tell you the reason?

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:38.510
Yeah.

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:40.640
I want to be like her.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.350
Be like her?

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:50.900
Pretty, outgoing, good at tennis, smart, loved by everyone...

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:56.280
I thought I might be able to change if I sat at her desk and saw the world from her perspective.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:01.010
But it didn't work at all.

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:03.420
I became so envious that I even started to cry.

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:07.020
She's always so nice to me, too.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:09.040
Self-control

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:08.250
Hateful, aren't I?

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:12.440
<i>I kind of understand how she feels.</i>

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:15.090
Maeda-kun!

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:17.720
No spacing out.

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:24.270
So everyone's here?

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:26.060
Then I shall take roll.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:26.600
Nakagawa.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:27.440
Here!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.320
First!

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:30.570
The cleavage between the breasts of a girl!

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.260
Second!

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:33.400
Standing, in her uniform, unaware!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.320
Third.

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:36.570
That a scoop shot takes only 0.3 seconds.

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:41.740
Maeda, you still don't remember your part?

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:42.870
Yeah.

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:44.640
Well, fine.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:46.600
Let's start our meeting.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:47.750
The topic is, obviously,

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.580
the Miss Photogenic Contest!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.210
I've been waiting for this!

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.880
Who's the target this year?

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.590
That's obvious.

00:17:57.180 --> 00:18:01.440
But before we continue, Uchida, check if the Photo Club is in.

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:02.180
Okay.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:07.560
No one's there.

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:08.730
Good.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:11.580
Now to announce this year's Miss Photogenic.

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:12.560
Nakagawa.

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:14.650
Miss Photogenic?

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:17.580
All right, Maeda. Listen well.

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:20.910
Miss Photogenic, you see, is a
tradition in our Photography Club

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:25.450
wherein we determine who appears most beautiful in photographs

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:28.670
and exhibit our findings at the school festival each year!

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:30.630
<i>What the heck?</i>

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.420
<i>I feel sorry for the girls.</i>

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:37.380
And Miss Photogenic for this year is...

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:41.680
Niimi Haruka!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:42.970
Wh-What?!

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:46.980
She didn't run away in any single competition, but in terms of total points, she's number one.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.800
She is a true heroine!

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:49.980
Any objections?

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:50.770
None here!

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:51.810
Agreed!

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:53.650
She's the best choice.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:56.900
So you were planning this all along.

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:03.200
I smell trouble already.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.200
Okay!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:09.210
Time for morning homeroom!

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:14.460
Or at least, it would be if someone had taken out the trash.

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:16.460
Who was in charge of it yesterday?

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:19.340
Come on, who was it? Throw it out already!

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:21.470
Okay.

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:24.600
That takes care of that.

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:29.140
Being allowed to leave during class doesn't happen often.

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:31.140
Guess I'll mess around a bit before going back.

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.150
What's that?

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:40.070
A photo opportunity!

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:44.910
M-Maeda-kun?!

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:47.410
No photos!

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:49.500
Stop!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.000
Stop that!

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:53.880
Careful!

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.310
Ow...

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:12.980
Are you all right?

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:14.480
Yes.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.610
How about you?

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:20.320
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.520
What is it?

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:28.500
I hope you weren't taking pictures up my skirt.

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:29.870
I wasn't!

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:31.260
Really?

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:33.080
Well, that's fine.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:35.380
But what were you doing here?

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:38.750
The teacher asked me to throw out the trash.

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:40.880
I see.

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:42.340
Muroto—

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:46.430
Senpai, why were you climbing over the wall here to get into the school?

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:48.890
W-Well, uh...

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:50.700
Mind if I take a guess?

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:52.270
You didn't want anyone
to know you were late.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.600
Is that it?

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:57.520
So you were entering the school illicitly.

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:00.400
E-Entering the school illicitly?

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:02.030
I wouldn't put it that way.

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:04.150
Then how <i>would</i> you put it?

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:06.440
Well, uh...

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:09.180
I'm sorry.

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:10.290
I was entering the school illicitly.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:16.190
<i>Wh-What's with this thrill I'm feeling?</i>

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:20.960
<i>It feels so good to beat Muroto-senpai at her own game.</i>

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:24.050
Don't tell anyone.

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:26.010
Please.

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:31.100
If anyone found out that I entered the school illicitly, my
reputation as the Student Council President would be ruined.

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:33.300
Sure, I won't tell anyone.

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:35.230
Really? Thank you.

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.740
Then could you delete those pictures? The ones that you just took?

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:40.520
Well, I'd rather not.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:41.480
Why not?

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:44.490
It'd be such a waste to delete them.

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:46.360
A waste?

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:47.410
Well, see you.

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:50.280
Wait right there!

00:21:50.730 --> 00:21:52.790
I won't show anyone!

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:54.790
Geez! That's a promise, got it?

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.460
Got it!

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:02.670
<i>And so, in a twist of fate,</i>

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:04.800
<i>I got some dirt on Muroto-senpai.</i>

00:22:08.070 --> 00:22:09.800
Oh, geez!

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:42.060
Unbelievable!

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:44.770
You've just joined the club, and you're already making waves!

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:47.280
You convinced an innocent
underclassman to let you observe practice.

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:49.690
You got shots of your childhood friend in a school swimsuit.

00:23:49.690 --> 00:23:53.110
You acquired some dirt on the
ever-strict Student Council President.

00:23:53.110 --> 00:23:54.570
Excellent!

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:56.220
Your future is bright!

00:23:56.220 --> 00:23:58.870
True art manifests itself when the artist is in the dominant position.

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:00.500
Throw away your common sense!

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:01.760
Feel shame in hesitation!

00:24:01.760 --> 00:24:04.750
Seek for borderline eroticism!

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:07.660
It's not my fault if you get punished for it, Niiyan!
